.TH pepe-rerun 1  pepe "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pepe\-rerun \- Run a saved test again, record the run, and say what moved since the run before
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpepe rerun\fR [\fB\-\-gate\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a saved test again, record the run, and say what moved since the run before
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-gate\fR
Exit 1 when the verdict is Slower or Worse, for CI
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The saved test, as `pepe history` lists them
